BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:luni-complet@owner
SUMMARY:💪 LUNI — Push + Suplimente + Skincare
DESCRIPTION:━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🏋️ 05:15-05:50 | PUSH — Piept + Umeri + Triceps (ACASA)\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🔥 Incalzire 5 min: jumping jacks + rotatii brate\n\n1. Flotari standard — 4x12\n2. Flotari cu mainile late (piept) — 3x12\n3. Flotari cu mainile stramte (triceps) — 3x12\n4. Flotari inclinate pe scaun (umeri/piept sus) — 3x10\n5. Pike push-ups (umeri) — 4x10\n6. Dips intre 2 scaune (triceps) — 3x12\n7. Ridicari laterale cu gantere/sticle apa — 3x15\n8. Plank cu atingere umeri — 3x20\n\n🧊 Stretching 5 min\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💊 05:50-06:00 | POST-WORKOUT + SKINCARE\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💊 Shake: Myprotein Whey 1 scoop (25g) + Creatina OstroVit 5g\n💊 Probiotic Secom Good Routine — 1 capsula (pe stomac semi-gol)\n\n🌅 SKINCARE DIMINEATA:\n1. CeraVe Foaming Cleanser — 1 doza\, 60 sec\, clateste cu apa RECE\n2. Revox Niacinamide 10%+Zinc — 2-3 picaturi\, bate usor\n3. Crema ochi cafeina — bob de orez pe inelar\, tamponeza usor\n4. ☀️ Elmiplant SPF 50+ — 2 degete pline (OBLIGATORIU!)\n\n🍳 MIC DEJUN (cu grasimi!):\n💊 OstroVit D3 4000IU+K2 — 1 tableta CU MASA\n💊 Moller's Forte Omega-3 — 1 capsula CU MASA\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💊 21:00 | MAGNEZIU\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nBoost4Life Magneziu Bisglicinat — 1-2 capsule cu apa\n→ Relaxare musculara + somn profund\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌙 21:30 | SKINCARE SEARA — RETINOL 🔴\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n1. CeraVe Foaming Cleanser — usuca COMPLET fata!\n2. Revox Retinol in Squalane — 2-3 picaturi pe fata USCATA\n   ⚠️ Saptamana 1: DOAR azi (Luni) si Joi — aclimatizare!\n   ⚠️ Saptamana 2+: Luni + Miercuri + Vineri\n3. Crema ochi cafeina — bob de orez\, tamponeza usor\n→ Culcare: 22:00-22:30
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Bucharest:20260615T051500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Bucharest:20260615T060000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=MO
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:marti-complet@owner
SUMMARY:💪 MARTI — Pull + Suplimente + Skincare
DESCRIPTION:━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🏋️ 05:15-05:50 | PULL — Spate + Biceps (ACASA)\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🔥 Incalzire 5 min\n\n1. Ramat cu gantere/sticle (un brat) — 4x12\n2. Ramat cu prosopul pe usa — 3x12\n3. Superman (spate inferior) — 4x15\n4. Flexii biceps cu gantere/sticle apa — 4x12\n5. Hammer curl — 3x12\n6. Tractiuni la bara (daca ai) / Negative pull-ups — 3x6\n7. Face pulls cu banda elastica — 3x15\n8. Shrugs cu gantere — 3x15\n\n🧊 Stretching 5 min\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💊 05:50-06:00 | POST-WORKOUT + SKINCARE\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💊 Shake: Whey 1 scoop (25g) + Creatina 5g\n💊 Probiotic Secom — 1 capsula\n\n🌅 SKINCARE DIMINEATA:\n1. CeraVe Foaming Cleanser\n2. Revox Niacinamide 10%+Zinc — 2-3 picaturi\n3. Crema ochi cafeina — tamponeza usor\n4. ☀️ Elmiplant SPF 50+ — OBLIGATORIU\n\n🍳 MIC DEJUN:\n💊 D3 4000IU+K2 + Omega-3 — CU MASA cu grasimi\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💊 21:00 | MAGNEZIU\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nBoost4Life Magneziu Bisglicinat — 1-2 capsule\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌙 21:30 | SKINCARE SEARA — PEPTIDE 🔵\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n1. CeraVe Foaming Cleanser\n⚠️ Saptamana 1 (pana pe 21 iun): produsele NU au ajuns — doar cleanser + crema ochi!\n\n✅ Din 22 iunie:\n2. Multi-Peptide + Cupru 1% — 3-4 picaturi pe fata\n3. Crema ochi cafeina — bob de orez\, tamponeza usor\n   💡 Tine crema la frigider 10 min inainte!\n→ Culcare: 22:00-22:30
